Package: epistle-panel
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, epistle, podup, glyndor-archive-keyring, adduser
Description: web panel for the epistle mail server, as a podup stack fragment
 epistle-panel is the web interface for epistle: webmail and administration
 on top of epistle's management API.
 .
 This package carries no application code and no Node runtime. The panel runs
 only inside its container image, ghcr.io/glyndor/epistle-panel, and this
 package installs the podup compose fragment that pins that image to the
 package version, together with the system account and the directories the
 fragment mounts. epistle adds the fragment to the stack it generates.
